
PowerPlant_Text_Guard0Intro::
    .string "The STORM roars in these halls.\p"
    .string "You are not invited.$"

PowerPlant_Text_Guard0Defeat::
    .string "Fried...$"

PowerPlant_Text_Guard0Post::
    .string "The ORACLE feels the thunder.$"

PowerPlant_Text_Guard1Intro::
    .string "We keep the bird's sky safe.$"

PowerPlant_Text_Guard1Defeat::
    .string "Short circuit...$"

PowerPlant_Text_Guard1Post::
    .string "Keep going, if you dare.$"

PowerPlant_Text_Guard2Intro::
    .string "Hear that hum? It is a warning.$"

PowerPlant_Text_Guard2Defeat::
    .string "Power out...$"

PowerPlant_Text_Guard2Post::
    .string "The ORACLE is just ahead.$"

PowerPlant_Text_Guard3Intro::
    .string "I am the ORACLE of the STORM.\n"
    .string "The bird sleeps under my watch.\p"
    .string "Prove that your spark is worth\n"
    .string "more than my fear.$"

PowerPlant_Text_Guard3Defeat::
    .string "...Then the storm has chosen you.$"

PowerPlant_Text_Guard3Post::
    .string "Go. Do not waste the lightning.$"

PowerPlant_Text_ZapdosGuarded::
    .string "Sparks crackle around ZAPDOS.\n"
    .string "The four channelers still guard\l"
    .string "it. They must all yield first.$"

